# The repo root is the generator chart. It packages each cluster's component groups
# (what .Files.Glob discovers) and k0sctl.yaml (templates/k0s-upgrade.yaml reads the k0s
# version from it). Exclude everything else, including the bootstrap manifests under
# <cluster>/flux-system.
.git/
# Local state outside git, which every local or CI render would otherwise read; .claude/
# holds whole worktrees.
.cache/
.claude/
*/flux-system/gotk-*.yaml
README.md
*/k0s-files/
.sops.yaml
